  {
    "id": "c4eff0a1-a3de-57f5-bffe-c46309e90d8b",
    "pack": "howl-of-the-wild",
    "kind": "armor",
    "slug": "armor:mamlambo-scale",
    "name": "Mamlambo Scale",
    "level": 10,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["invested", "magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "howl-of-the-wild",
        "page": 100,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=3197"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The faint glow beneath the thick, algae-green scales of this suit of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+1 resilient scale mail",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " hints at the armor's source."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Luminous Lure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate, light, manipulate, mental, visual)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "mamlambo scale",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " sheds dim light in a 20-foot emanation. The light has a duration of 1 minute, but you can extinguish the light with an Interact action. A creature that begins its turn in the light must attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:will",
            "dc": 26
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save. Regardless of the save's result, the creature is temporarily immune for 1 hour."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "60c53eba-abda-5f9a-b73c-1b4f63cf4a44"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The creature is unaffected."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Success",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The creature is Slowed 1 for 1 round."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The creature is Fascinated, and for as long as it remains in the light, it must spend at least 1 of its actions on each of its turns to move closer to the source of the light. If the creature ends its movement adjacent to you, it is slowed 1 until it is out of the light or until you make a Strike against it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Critical Failure",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " As failure, but the creature is also Off-Guard against the first Strike you make against it while it is slowed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Craft Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The initial raw materials must include the scales and hide of a mamlambo."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
